{"title": "Grim Visage", "pageid": 12392, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Grim_Visage", "categories": ["Creatures", "Races", "Non-playable races", "Undead"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Visage_of_Guilt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Visage_of_Guilt.png/300px-Visage_of_Guilt.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Visage_of_Guilt.png/450px-Visage_of_Guilt.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Visage_of_Guilt.png/600px-Visage_of_Guilt.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Visage_of_Guilt.png/300px-Visage_of_Guilt.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"375\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Visage_of_Guilt.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The Visage of Guilt</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Grim visages</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>. They haunt the <a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Tollhouse\" title=\"Reithwin Tollhouse\">Reithwin Tollhouse</a> alongside its tollmaster <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a>, muttering madness the whole time. Each grim visage resembles a floating skull filled with billowing green smoke.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100px; height: 100px; clip-path: xywh(0 0 100% 100% round 15%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Portrait_Grim_Visage.png/100px-Portrait_Grim_Visage.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Portrait_Grim_Visage.png/150px-Portrait_Grim_Visage.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4d/Portrait_Grim_Visage.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Portrait_Grim_Visage.png/100px-Portrait_Grim_Visage.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Portrait_Grim_Visage.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">These skulls spawned from Gerringothe Thorm's twisted psyche. Manifestations of her worst flaws, they keep the coins of her protective armour intact.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— In-game racial description</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About_grim_visages\">About grim visages</span></h2>\n<p>Each visage guards a portion of the <a href=\"/wiki/Accursed_Coins\" title=\"Accursed Coins\">accursed coins</a> that provide Gerringothe with her power. Each visage destroyed will, in turn, remove 100 of her maximum hit points and a piece of her <a href=\"/wiki/Coin_Armour\" title=\"Coin Armour\">Coin Armour</a>. Outside of combat, each visage is protected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Visage_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Visage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Visage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Visage_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Visage (Condition)\">Shadow Visage</a>, preventing the party from preemptively weakening Gerringothe.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Racial_Features\">Racial Features</span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/38px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creature Speed Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Base Racial Speed</dt>\n<dd>12m / 40ft</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/38px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creature Size Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Size</dt>\n<dd>Tiny</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Accursed_Coins\" title=\"Accursed Coins\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/40px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/60px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Accursed Coins\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png/40px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Gold_Pile_Medium_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Accursed_Coins\" title=\"Accursed Coins\">Accursed Coins</a></span></dt><dd>This cursed visage controls part of the coins protecting the <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Toll Collector</a>.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/60px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/80px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a></span></dt><dd>Can see in the dark up to 12 m (40 ft).</dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_grim_visage_characters\">Known grim visage characters</span></h2>\n<p>There are six visages in total:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Cowardice\" title=\"Visage of Cowardice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Portrait_Visage_of_Cowardice.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Cowardice.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Portrait_Visage_of_Cowardice.png/45px-Portrait_Visage_of_Cowardice.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Portrait_Visage_of_Cowardice.png/60px-Portrait_Visage_of_Cowardice.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Visage of Cowardice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Portrait_Visage_of_Cowardice.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Cowardice.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Portrait_Visage_of_Cowardice.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Cowardice\" title=\"Visage of Cowardice\">Visage of Cowardice</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Greed\" title=\"Visage of Greed\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Portrait_Visage_of_Greed.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Greed.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Portrait_Visage_of_Greed.png/45px-Portrait_Visage_of_Greed.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Portrait_Visage_of_Greed.png/60px-Portrait_Visage_of_Greed.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Visage of Greed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Portrait_Visage_of_Greed.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Greed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Portrait_Visage_of_Greed.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Greed\" title=\"Visage of Greed\">Visage of Greed</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Guilt\" title=\"Visage of Guilt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Visage_of_Guilt.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Guilt.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Visage_of_Guilt.png/45px-Portrait_Visage_of_Guilt.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Visage_of_Guilt.png/60px-Portrait_Visage_of_Guilt.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Visage of Guilt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Visage_of_Guilt.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Guilt.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Portrait_Visage_of_Guilt.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Guilt\" title=\"Visage of Guilt\">Visage of Guilt</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Heartlessness\" title=\"Visage of Heartlessness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Portrait_Visage_of_Heartlessness.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Heartlessness.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Portrait_Visage_of_Heartlessness.png/45px-Portrait_Visage_of_Heartlessness.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Portrait_Visage_of_Heartlessness.png/60px-Portrait_Visage_of_Heartlessness.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Visage of Heartlessness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Portrait_Visage_of_Heartlessness.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Heartlessness.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Portrait_Visage_of_Heartlessness.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Heartlessness\" title=\"Visage of Heartlessness\">Visage of Heartlessness</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Obedience\" title=\"Visage of Obedience\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Portrait_Visage_of_Obedience.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Obedience.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Portrait_Visage_of_Obedience.png/45px-Portrait_Visage_of_Obedience.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Portrait_Visage_of_Obedience.png/60px-Portrait_Visage_of_Obedience.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Visage of Obedience\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Portrait_Visage_of_Obedience.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Obedience.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Portrait_Visage_of_Obedience.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Obedience\" title=\"Visage of Obedience\">Visage of Obedience</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Regret\" title=\"Visage of Regret\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Portrait_Visage_of_Regret.png/30px-Portrait_Visage_of_Regret.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Portrait_Visage_of_Regret.png/45px-Portrait_Visage_of_Regret.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Portrait_Visage_of_Regret.png/60px-Portrait_Visage_of_Regret.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Visage of Regret\" src=\"